[{"title":"重送许永宁 其一","author":"李攀龙","text":"绝域天应断，扬波海未平。\n浮云随薄宦，华发系微名。\n传檄西南定，褰帷瘴疠清。\n看君饶卧理，经术晚逾成。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24108,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"重送许永宁 其二","author":"李攀龙","text":"世情今可见，此谪竟堪陈。\n偃蹇难容汝，文章不利人。\n清秋炎海外，落日大荒滨。\n莫更埋铜柱，功名老汉臣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24109,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"郡斋送张肖甫 其一","author":"李攀龙","text":"蓟门相忆处，岂不问加餐。\n卧理非吾意，诗名向尔看。\n白云尊酒尽，山色郡斋寒。\n莫惜重投辖，秋风道路难。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24110,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"郡斋送张肖甫 其二","author":"李攀龙","text":"送君何所有，城上太行山。\n落日堪相忆，浮云未可攀。\n俱言张翰去，得御李膺还。\n莫自悲秋色，能摧壮士颜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24111,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"阁夜示茂秦 其一","author":"李攀龙","text":"相逢殊不恶，久别竟谁驩。\n贫病他乡老，交游古道难。\n开樽山欲出，说剑雪逾寒。\n如此萧条色，高斋尔自看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24112,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"阁夜示茂秦 其二","author":"李攀龙","text":"为客今犹在，浮名信已劳。\n病来衰綵笔，老至恋绨袍。\n阁卧风尘过，衔杯夜色高。\n旧知江夏守，不厌祢生豪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24113,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"阁夜示茂秦 其三","author":"李攀龙","text":"病起看时事，归心不可裁。\n著书官欲罢，问字客还来。\n月出樽堪满，霜清角自哀。\n相怜成白首，明日阻三台。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24114,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"阁夜示茂秦 其四","author":"李攀龙","text":"把袂今何夕，高斋雨雪清。\n诗才君矍铄，酒兴我从横。\n同病无交态，相依岂世情。\n春来徵渤海，陈对引王生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24115,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄元美 其一","author":"李攀龙","text":"我昔朝宗日，君停使者轩。\n并驱皆上驷，相遇复中原。\n草昧时人起，风尘国士恩。\n别来春色满，无处不销䰟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24116,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄元美 其二","author":"李攀龙","text":"若问除书意，君何异积薪。\n姓名常借客，踪迹竟疑人。\n为郡空高第，当朝各要津。\n拂衣吾所欲，不是避风尘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24117,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄元美 其三","author":"李攀龙","text":"渔阳春欲尽，汉使未堪愁。\n边郡多豪侠，风尘一壮游。\n浮云寒大漠，白日澹幽州。\n莫更观辽海，萧条正北流。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24118,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄元美 其四","author":"李攀龙","text":"何悟淹为郡，风尘日以难。\n宦情疏自解，人事拙相看。\n高枕西山色，清斋大麓寒。\n期君秋月满，从此挂吾冠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24119,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夏日行部遇明卿子与于瘿陶邑","author":"李攀龙","text":"何来漳水上，早晚发长安。\n放逐吾曹在，风尘此道难。\n孤城高自卧，万事醉相看。\n莫击邹阳剑，霜飞五月寒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24120,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"郡斋与元美赋","author":"李攀龙","text":"握手今何在，高斋共此樽。\n众人方睥睨，二子向乾坤。\n经术从吾浅，诗名得尔尊。\n当时杨马辈，谁复在金门。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24121,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送元美 其一","author":"李攀龙","text":"吾曹天地在，不惜滞风尘。\n意气能无合，文章自有真。\n齐名他日事，侧目此时人。\n为别还秋色，樽前白发新。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24122,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送元美 其二","author":"李攀龙","text":"把酒论离索，褰帷送友生。\n白云高大麓，秋色重孤城。\n偃蹇还诗句，萧条自世情。\n赠君无赵璧，落日片心明。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24123,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"黄河","author":"李攀龙","text":"复就三秦役，还为四牡歌。\n北风扬片席，大雪渡黄河。\n才岂诸郎少，名非一郡多。\n儒官明主意，吾道好蹉跎。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24124,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"关门雪望","author":"李攀龙","text":"西来千里雪，斜日满函关。\n秋水何当落，浮云自不还。\n积阴高紫气，寒色壮秦山。\n似欲欺双鬓，苍茫到客颜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24125,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"发长安","author":"李攀龙","text":"此处看春色，萧条客自禁。\n风尘为郡过，踪迹抱关深。\n不尽传经意，难言作赋心。\n故人多道路，薄宦有登临。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24126,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"泾州","author":"李攀龙","text":"回磴层云上，孤城返照间。\n人烟趋白阪，睥睨走青山。\n刍粟浮泾下，旌旗度陇还。\n时看乘障吏，车马出萧关。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24127,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋日 其一","author":"李攀龙","text":"薄游寒暑换，仍自滞孤城。\n华发看人事，浮云识宦情。\n拂衣驱病色，悬榻避时名。\n但欲眠清昼，相嘲任友生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24128,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋日 其二","author":"李攀龙","text":"此物还堪惜，何官不可休。\n驱驰如昨日，药饵更清秋。\n名已千人废，家徒四壁愁。\n南山归自好，沮溺本同流。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24129,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋日 其三","author":"李攀龙","text":"倦游非一日，乘兴复三秦。\n多病难为客，浮名喜中人。\n未堪沈案牍，何以走风尘。\n祖帐东门外，贤哉一老臣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24130,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋日 其四","author":"李攀龙","text":"还乡明日事，可奈簿书劳。\n弃置看同病，风尘避二毛。\n酒如泾水浊，枕对华山高。\n不是清秋色，何人见反骚。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24131,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"五日和许傅湖亭宴集 其一","author":"李攀龙","text":"城头片雨悬，客醉㟙湖边。\n酒奈榴花妒，人堪桂树怜。\n五丝还令节，双鬓抵流年。\n莫蹋王孙草，淮南赋已传。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24132,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"五日和许傅湖亭宴集 其二","author":"李攀龙","text":"青樽临北渚，一为故人开。\n此事成今昔，浮云自往来。\n花间携枕簟，镜里出楼台。\n忽就投湘赋，深知贾谊才。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24133,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄元美","author":"李攀龙","text":"寥落文章事，相逢白首新。\n微吾竟长夜，念尔和阳春。\n把酒千门雪，论交四海人。\n即今燕市里，击筑好谁亲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24134,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠子与","author":"李攀龙","text":"握手论文者，春来限各天。\n即今行乐处，不似旧游年。\n神物风尘里，时名我辈前。\n岂令徐孺榻，白日此长悬。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24135,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"汪员外移水部时城京师汪为植","author":"李攀龙","text":"闻有金城役，抡兹水部才。\n中原忧被发，使者咏于䰄。\n睥睨燕山接，风云瀚海来。\n悬知胡骑遁，天子宴蓬莱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24136,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"即事 其一","author":"李攀龙","text":"羽书秋色外，飞挽海陵回。\n日上犁庭议，时难度漠才。\n物情奇士过，天造异人来。\n侧席劳明主，黄金正满台。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24137,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"即事 其二","author":"李攀龙","text":"即今难授钺，谁可静胡尘。\n谈笑存能事，艰虞失众人。\n大军归掌握，王者自经纶。\n不复忧骄悍，如林护北辰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24138,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"即事 其三","author":"李攀龙","text":"使者晨驰壁，夺归平虏章。\n自天悬斧钺，择日设坛场。\n万马中原集，诸军上苑旁。\n主恩无可报，一战取名王。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24139,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"即事 其四","author":"李攀龙","text":"天子何神武，乘秋欲破胡。\n儒臣擐甲胄，大将解兵符。\n叱咤风云合，艰危日月扶。\n北瞻陵寝色，葱郁近皇都。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24140,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"广阳山道中","author":"李攀龙","text":"出峡还何地，杉松郁不开。\n雷声千嶂落，雨色万峰来。\n地胜纡王事，年饥损吏才。\n难将忧旱意，涕泣向蒿莱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24141,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赵州道中","author":"李攀龙","text":"独往何为者，栖栖意不欢。\n褰帷秋雨过，伏轼夏云残。\n潦水阴相积，蒹葭晚自寒。\n大夫方跋涉，天步属艰难。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24142,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"吴舍人丧内 其一","author":"李攀龙","text":"楚妃色殊众，不独下堂悲。\n鼓瑟潇湘夜，秋云未可持。\n河流双露掌，月出万年枝。\n属有将雏曲，能无泣凤池。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24143,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"吴舍人丧内 其二","author":"李攀龙","text":"可怜御沟水，见此白头吟。\n病客思江郡，词臣在上林。\n春风动花树，秋月散清砧。\n唯有陵阳泪，知君抱玉心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24144,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和殿卿白云亭醉歌","author":"李攀龙","text":"狂杀王门客，空亭日啸歌。\n那知珠履散，自爱白云多。\n短发明秋水，长裾曳芰荷。\n独怜枚叟在，不复厌婆娑。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24145,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"元美以家难羁京作此为唁 其一","author":"李攀龙","text":"驰骋淄渑日，功名与宦情。\n高堂一为坐，世路遂相轻。\n行乞还燕市，悲歌复蓟城。\n佩刀风雨夜，堪作箾中鸣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24146,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"元美以家难羁京作此为唁 其二","author":"李攀龙","text":"一自抽簪后，漂零见此身。\n通章寻悟主，怀刺更依人。\n寒入绨袍色，愁生黍谷春。\n不因家难剧，君岂在风尘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24147,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"元美以家难羁京作此为唁 其三","author":"李攀龙","text":"海内论兄弟，萧条二子才。\n一时称病罢，万里拂衣来。\n雨雪人高卧，蓬蒿客自回。\n偶然占剑气，夜夜向燕台。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24148,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"元美以家难羁京作此为唁 其四","author":"李攀龙","text":"闻道周旋地，偏承老父颜。\n橐饘时在侧，宾客稍居閒。\n函谷更封出，夷门执辔还。\n莫将公子泪，乱漫洒燕山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24149,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日闲居 其一","author":"李攀龙","text":"即令关请谒，何用乞江湖。\n僻性终难狎，浮名本易污。\n杜门人事过，欹枕岁华徂。\n薄俗还堪畏，崎岖比宦途。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24150,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日闲居 其二","author":"李攀龙","text":"白日移高枕，青山答放歌。\n病才宜偃蹇，老自厌婆娑。\n礼数诸生绝，交游二仲多。\n江湖春正满，更欲混渔蓑。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24151,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日闲居 其三","author":"李攀龙","text":"药饵休官懒，蓬高谢客深。\n浊醪殊解事，高枕自知音。\n老大翻陵劲，文章岂陆沈。\n浮云终日在，潇洒竟何心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24152,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日闲居 其四","author":"李攀龙","text":"五羖功名薄，双龙羽翼乖。\n风尘凋短褐，雨雪闭高斋。\n惨淡幽人色，飞扬壮士怀。\n少年何太苦，妖冶事形骸。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24153,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日闲居 其五","author":"李攀龙","text":"奉使谈经日，单车西入关。\n抡才牛口下，得士凤毛间。\n白雪千人失，黄河万里还。\n即今高卧处，犹不减商山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24154,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日闲居 其六","author":"李攀龙","text":"乞归君已见，削迹我何求。\n交态疏能变，时名久自休。\n中原来病色，万里入春愁。\n不是忘机客，还惊海上鸥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24155,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日闲居 其七","author":"李攀龙","text":"结舌论文地，甘心养拙年。\n朱门人自老，白雪调空传。\n世路蓬蒿外，浮名燕雀前。\n中原二三子，夙昔共周旋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24156,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日闲居 其八","author":"李攀龙","text":"病起独登台，春光万里来。\n浮沉还我辈，俯仰见人才。\n华发风尘过，青山雨雪开。\n浮云堪倚杖，落日好衔杯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24157,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日闲居 其九","author":"李攀龙","text":"漂零唯浊酒，落拓总狂生。\n彭泽差闻道，高阳横得名。\n罢来诗惨淡，卧久兴凄清。\n日对春湖色，潺湲懒濯缨。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24158,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日闲居 其十","author":"李攀龙","text":"五柳㟙湖滨，先生隐是真。\n文章堪侧目，潦倒竟全身。\n何必论交地，长须纵酒人。\n即令东蹈海，断不混风尘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24159,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夏日东村卧病 其一","author":"李攀龙","text":"平生偏伏枕，睱日是抽簪。\n病著青山色，愁高白雪音。\n云霄悬出处，踪迹间浮沉。\n不必名俱毁，方知二仲心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24160,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夏日东村卧病 其二","author":"李攀龙","text":"放歌知帝力，纵饮见天真。\n綵笔风云老，青樽日月新。\n诗惊啖蔗客，酒让采薇人。\n即使妨幽事，何须傍隐沦。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24161,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夏日东村卧病 其三","author":"李攀龙","text":"自甘成独往，谁复病相怜。\n金尽论交地，囊馀解摈篇。\n清斋芳药饵，华发媚林泉。\n不必忧生事，深耕种秫田。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24162,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夏日东村卧病 其四","author":"李攀龙","text":"不谓幽栖处，还堪抱膝吟。\n大云千里驻，片雨二湖阴。\n暑逼藤萝浅，凉生栝柏深。\n鲍山终日在，知己愧黄金。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24163,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夏日东村卧病 其五","author":"李攀龙","text":"未同疏雨至，勿剪夏云繁。\n片华樽前出，双流树杪翻。\n红颜辞上国，白眼入中原。\n慢世吾何敢，风尘且避喧。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24164,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夏日东村卧病 其六","author":"李攀龙","text":"拂衣先达怪，高枕故人疑。\n世路衡门左，轩车负郭迟。\n少年誇解事，薄俗讳言诗。\n何处堪遥集，悠悠未有期。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24165,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夏日东村卧病 其七","author":"李攀龙","text":"每逢河朔饮，辄忆广陵涛。\n起色含佳句，流光逼浊醪。\n兴缘知己尽，名岂罢官高。\n髀肉看如此，何论长二毛。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24166,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夏日东村卧病 其八","author":"李攀龙","text":"空林风雨过，潇洒一樽开。\n看竹俄蠲疾，漂蓬敢负才。\n杜门辞问字，落日罢登台。\n不是怜嵇阮，谁堪把臂来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24167,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夏日东村卧病 其九","author":"李攀龙","text":"夜半忽风雨，层楼四望孤。\n雷盘华不注，电划大明湖。\n云雾连屏叠，蛟龙抱剑呼。\n飞扬天地意，垂老见吾徒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24168,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夏日东村卧病 其十","author":"李攀龙","text":"何物子虚赋，深承汉主知。\n一逢杨得意，千载遂同时。\n谏猎功名薄，为郎日月私。\n閒居堪避事，称病足逶迤。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24169,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夏日东村卧病 其十一","author":"李攀龙","text":"更阅人间语，谁堪出处同。\n江湖星自客，词赋日犹工。\n物色馀争席，生涯见转蓬。\n延陵皮相士，竟失被裘翁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24170,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夏日东村卧病 其十二","author":"李攀龙","text":"白头明日事，君不见交情。\n千载论知己，中原命友生。\n青云高病色，沧海傍诗名。\n一为弹冠误，徒令国士轻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24171,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋日村居 其一","author":"李攀龙","text":"隐几怜清晓，开轩命浊醪。\n西风行薜荔，白露缀蒲桃。\n气逼蝉声苦，天含雁影高。\n壮心堪自见，秋色正滔滔。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24172,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋日村居 其二","author":"李攀龙","text":"病色还相假，秋光溘自开。\n清羸堪傍竹，潦倒重衔杯。\n返照湖边尽，浮云海上来。\n即今知九辩，无处不悲哉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24173,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋日村居 其三","author":"李攀龙","text":"秋意长西北，苕荛望里分。\n青含仙署雨，白动帝乡云。\n屈宋终难达，巢由故不群。\n江湖三十载，摇落好谁闻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24174,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋日村居 其四","author":"李攀龙","text":"南山伏枕前，北渚濯缨边。\n林薄秋逾厉，云霞晓自鲜。\n谈诗成白首，把酒望青天。\n万里中原色，萧条此地偏。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24175,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋日村居 其五","author":"李攀龙","text":"不必知名姓，中原一病夫。\n柴荆存古色，药饵泥穷途。\n落日悬鱼笱，西风缠辘轳。\n生涯君自见，百亩白云湖。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24176,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋日村居 其六","author":"李攀龙","text":"高斋清自掩，遥夕病相看。\n片月花间净，明河树杪乾。\n流萤含火著，宿鹭抱霜寒。\n何限同袍意，江湖坐渺漫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24177,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}}]